{"arm": "S2", "context_pages": [["9e092bb4d317944f9b65229c7d6cd2efe8032505deb88b934aa3a34f810884e6", 137]], "flow_bucket": "1_corpus_lookup_extraction", "http_status": 200, "label": "SCORED", "latency_ms": 23001, "majority_samples": 3, "model_params_hash": "afec57e6000f365bfd8e1584973673ecf7e6aaaff4237f52e39695d1bfdd6277", "output": "To find the total equity for Aurobindo Pharma for the year ended March 31, 2024, we refer to the \"Equity\" section of the financial statements. \n\nFrom the given data:\n- Equity share capital is 585.9 million.\n- Other equity is 196,642.3 million.\n\nAdding these two values together gives the total equity:\n$$ 585.9 + 196,642.3 = 197,228.2 $$\n\nThus, the total equity is 197,228.2 million Indian Rupees.\n\n{\n  \"answer_kind\": \"value\",\n  \"answer_value\": 197228.2,\n  \"unit\": \"million Indian Rupees\",\n  \"period\": \"year ended March 31, 2024\",\n  \"basis\": \"Balance Sheet\",\n  \"citations\": [\n    \"document_id=9e092bb4d317944f9b65229c7d6cd2efe8032505deb88b934aa3a34f810884e6 page=137\"\n  ],\n  \"abstain\": false,\n  \"reason\": \"Total equity is calculated by summing equity share capital and other equity from the balance sheet.\"\n}", "prompt_set_hash": "abc60a7fb40cc1a4b6109b37103000abc826d9961867d71cf690233dd5da7228", "rendered_prompt_hash": "57c3af09b95f276a884e05ffe674c61dc858812fd4b7551dde9e8633da59d81b", "rendered_prompt_hashes": ["57c3af09b95f276a884e05ffe674c61dc858812fd4b7551dde9e8633da59d81b", "57c3af09b95f276a884e05ffe674c61dc858812fd4b7551dde9e8633da59d81b", "57c3af09b95f276a884e05ffe674c61dc858812fd4b7551dde9e8633da59d81b"], "row_id": "G-044", "run_id": "phase2_v1_20261112T173032Z", "samples": [{"http_status": 200, "latency_ms": 6889, "output": "To find the total equity for Aurobindo Pharma for the year ended March 31, 2024, we refer to the \"Equity\" section of the financial statements. \n\nFrom the given data:\n- Equity share capital is 585.9 million.\n- Other equity is 196,642.3 million.\n\nAdding these two values together gives the total equity:\n$$ 585.9 + 196,642.3 = 197,228.2 $$\n\nThus, the total equity is 197,228.2 million Indian Rupees.\n\n{\n  \"answer_kind\": \"value\",\n  \"answer_value\": 197228.2,\n  \"unit\": \"million Indian Rupees\",\n  \"period\": \"year ended March 31, 2024\",\n  \"basis\": \"Balance Sheet\",\n  \"citations\": [\n    \"document_id=9e092bb4d317944f9b65229c7d6cd2efe8032505deb88b934aa3a34f810884e6 page=137\"\n  ],\n  \"abstain\": false,\n  \"reason\": \"Total equity is calculated by summing equity share capital and other equity from the balance sheet.\"\n}", "status": "answered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 306, "prompt_tokens": 2644, "prompt_tokens_details": null, "total_tokens": 2950}}, {"http_status": 200, "latency_ms": 7810, "output": "To determine the total equity of Aurobindo Pharma for the year ended March 31, 2024, we refer to the \"Equity\" section of the balance sheet. According to the provided document, the total equity is calculated as the sum of \"Equity share capital\" and \"Other equity.\" \n\n- Equity share capital is listed as 585.9 million rupees.\n- Other equity is listed as 196,642.3 million rupees.\n\nAdding these two values:\n$$ 585.9 + 196,642.3 = 197,228.2 $$\n\nThus, the total equity of Aurobindo Pharma for the year ended March 31, 2024, is 197,228.2 million rupees.\n\n{\n  \"answer_kind\": \"value\",\n  \"answer_value\": 197228.2,\n  \"unit\": \"million rupees\",\n  \"period\": \"year ended March 31, 2024\",\n  \"basis\": \"balance sheet\",\n  \"citations\": [\"document_id=9e092bb4d317944f9b65229c7d6cd2efe8032505deb88b934aa3a34f810884e6 page=137\"],\n  \"abstain\": false,\n  \"reason\": \"The total equity is calculated as the sum of equity share capital and other equity from the balance sheet.\"\n}", "status": "answered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 347, "prompt_tokens": 2644, "prompt_tokens_details": null, "total_tokens": 2991}}, {"http_status": 200, "latency_ms": 8302, "output": "To determine the total equity of Aurobindo Pharma for the year ended March 31, 2024, we refer to the \"Equity\" section of the financial statements. \n\n1. The \"Equity\" section includes two main components:\n   - (a) Equity share capital\n   - (b) Other equity\n\n2. From the provided data:\n   - Equity share capital = 585.9 million rupees\n   - Other equity = 196,642.3 million rupees\n\n3. Adding these two components together gives the total equity.\n\n$$\n\\text{Total Equity} = \\text{Equity share capital} + \\text{Other equity} = 585.9 + 196,642.3 = 197,228.2 \\text{ million rupees}\n$$\n\n{\n  \"answer_kind\": \"value\",\n  \"answer_value\": 197228.2,\n  \"unit\": \"million rupees\",\n  \"period\": \"year ended March 31, 2024\",\n  \"basis\": \"standalone financial statements\",\n  \"citations\": [\n    \"document_id=9e092bb4d317944f9b65229c7d6cd2efe8032505deb88b934aa3a34f810884e6 page=137\"\n  ],\n  \"abstain\": false,\n  \"reason\": \"The total equity value is derived from the 'Equity' section of the standalone financial statements, which includes the equity share capital and other equity components.\"\n}", "status": "answered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 369, "prompt_tokens": 2644, "prompt_tokens_details": null, "total_tokens": 3013}}], "score": {"gold_abstain": false, "pred_abstain": false, "abstain_correct": true, "false_answer": false, "false_abstention": false, "gold_answer_kind": "numeric", "pred_answer_kind": "numeric", "numeric_match": true, "entity_match": null, "citation_valid": true, "parse_ok": true}, "status": "answered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 1022, "prompt_tokens": 7932, "total_tokens": 8954}, "score_v1": {"abstain_correct": true, "citation_valid": true, "entity_match": null, "false_abstention": false, "false_answer": false, "gold_abstain": false, "gold_answer_kind": "numeric", "numeric_match": true, "parse_ok": true, "pred_abstain": false, "pred_answer_kind": "numeric"}, "scorer_version": "v2_unit_norm"}
