e31018cb35429e72eafe\"],\n  \"abstain\": false,\n  \"reason\": \"The total expenses for the year ended 31 March 2024 are explicitly stated as 8,26,189 crore in the Consolidated Statement of Profit and Loss.\"\n}", "status": "answered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 230, "prompt_tokens": 1838, "prompt_tokens_details": null, "total_tokens": 2068}}], "score": {"gold_abstain": false, "pred_abstain": false, "abstain_correct": true, "false_answer": false, "false_abstention": false, "gold_answer_kind": "numeric", "pred_answer_kind": "numeric", "numeric_match": true, "entity_match": null, "citation_valid": false, "parse_ok": true}, "status": "answered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 745, "prompt_tokens": 5514, "total_tokens": 6259}, "score_v1": {"abstain_correct": true, "citation_valid": false, "entity_match": null, "false_abstention": false, "false_answer": false, "gold_abstain": false, "gold_answer_kind": "numeric", "numeric_match": true, "parse_ok": true, "pred_abstain": false, "pred_answer_kind": "numeric"}, "scorer_version": "v2_unit_norm"}
{"arm": "S2", "context_pages": [["deed15eaf8d7b9e0fa2aa386b85a01f35511fc8b4813fe92aa4212682089473d", 295]], "flow_bucket": "1_corpus_lookup_extraction", "http_status": 200, "label": "SCORED", "latency_ms": 21871, "majority_samples": 3, "model_params_hash": "afec57e6000f365bfd8e1584973673ecf7e6aaaff4237f52e39695d1bfdd6277", "output": "The revenue from operations for the year ended 31st March 2026, as reported in the consolidated financial statements, is calculated by subtracting the discounts and variable consideration from the revenue as per the contracted price. According to the reconciliation provided in the document:\n\n- Revenue as per contracted price for the year ended 31st March, 2026 is 12,927 crore.\n- Discount on prompt payments for the year ended 31st March, 2026 is 119 crore.\n- Variable consideration for the year ended 31st March, 2026 is 4 crore.\n\nThus, the revenue from operations is calculated as follows:\n\n$$ \\text{Revenue from operations} = \\text{Revenue as per contracted price} - \\text{Discount on prompt payments} - \\text{Variable consideration} $$\n\n$$ \\text{Revenue from operations} = 12,927 - 119 - 4 = 12,804 \\text{ crore} $$\n\nTherefore, the revenue from operations for the year ended 31st March 2026 is 12,804 crore.\n\n{\n  \"answer_kind\": \"value\",\n  \"answer_value\": 12804,\n  \"unit\": \"crore\",\n  \"period\": \"year\",\n  \"basis\": \"financial_statement\",\n  \"citations\": [\n    \"document_id=deed15eaf8d7b9e0fa2aa386b85a01f35511fc8b4813fe92aa4212682089473d page=295\"\n  ],\n  \"abstain\": false,\n  \"reason\": \"The revenue from operations is derived from the reconciliation of the revenue as per contracted price, adjusted for discounts and variable consideration, as provided in the consolidated financial statements.\"\n}", "prompt_set_hash": "abc60a7fb40cc1a4b6109b37103000abc826d9961867d71cf690233dd5da7228", "rendered_prompt_hash": "3149e39fdcf8cd7c0b93f2742773286acbd07a4ae0b446010c231fbcd74bab1f", "rendered_prompt_hashes": ["3149e39fdcf8cd7c0b93f2742773286acbd07a4ae0b446010c231fbcd74bab1f", "3149e39fdcf8cd7c0b93f2742773286acbd07a4ae0b446010c231fbcd74bab1f", "3149e39fdcf8cd7c0b93f2742773286acbd07a4ae0b446010c231fbcd74bab1f"], "row_id": "G-062", "run_id": "phase2_v1_20261112T173032Z", "samples": [{"http_status": 200, "latency_ms": 9699, "output": "The revenue from operations for the year ended 31st March 2026, as reported in the consolidated financial statements, is calculated by subtracting the discounts and variable consideration from the revenue as per the contracted price. According to the reconciliation provided in the document:\n\n- Revenue as per contracted price for the year ended 31st March, 2026 is 12,927 crore.\n- Discount on prompt payments for the year ended 31st March, 2026 is 119 crore.\n- Variable consideration for the year ended 31st March, 2026 is 4 crore.\n\nThus, the revenue from operations is calculated as follows:\n\n$$ \\text{Revenue from operations} = \\text{Revenue as per contracted price} - \\text{Discount on prompt payments} - \\text{Variable consideration} $$\n\n$$ \\text{Revenue from operations} = 12,927 - 119 - 4 = 12,804 \\text{ crore} $$\n\nTherefore, the revenue from operations for the year ended 31st March 2026 is 12,804 crore.\n\n{\n  \"answer_kind\": \"value\",\n  \"answer_value\": 12804,\n  \"unit\": \"crore\",\n  \"period\": \"year\",\n  \"basis\": \"financial_statement\",\n  \"citations\": [\n    \"document_id=deed15eaf8d7b9e0fa2aa386b85a01f35511fc8b4813fe92aa4212682089473d page=295\"\n  ],\n  \"abstain\": false,\n  \"reason\": \"The revenue from operations is derived from the reconciliation of the revenue as per contracted price, adjusted for discounts and variable consideration, as provided in the consolidated financial statements.\"\n}", "status": "answered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 418, "prompt_tokens": 2849, "prompt_tokens_details": null, "total_tokens": 3267}}, {"http_status": 200, "latency_ms": 6233, "output": "The revenue from operations for the year ended 31st March, 2026, as per the consolidated financial statements, is reported as `12,804 crore. This figure is derived from the reconciliation of the revenue as per the contracted price, after accounting for discounts on prompt payments and variable consideration. The revenue from operations, as printed in the statement of profit and loss, is `12,804 crore.\n\n{\n  \"answer_kind\": \"value\",\n  \"answer_value\": 12804,\n  \"unit\": \"crore\",\n  \"period\": \"year\",\n  \"basis\": \"statement\",\n  \"citations\": [\"[document_id=deed15eaf8d7b9e0fa2aa386b85a01f35511fc8b4813fe92aa4212682089473d page=295]\"],\n  \"abstain\": false,\n  \"reason\": \"The revenue from operations for the year ended 31st March, 2026, is explicitly stated as `12,804 crore in the reconciliation table on page 295 of the provided document.\"\n}", "status": "answered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 269, "prompt_tokens": 2849, "prompt_tokens_details": null, "total_tokens": 3118}}, {"http_status": 200, "latency_ms": 5939, "output": "The revenue from operations for the year ended 31st March 2026, as reported in the statement of profit and loss, is provided in the reconciliation of the revenue recognised with the contracted price. According to the given data, the \"Revenue from contract with customers\" is 12,804 crore. This value represents the revenue from operations as reported in the consolidated financial statements for the year ended 31st March 2026.\n\n{\n  \"answer_kind\": \"value\",\n  \"answer_value\": 12804,\n  \"unit\": \"crore\",\n  \"period\": \"year\",\n  \"basis\": \"consolidated financial statements\",\n  \"citations\": [\n    \"Notes to Consolidated Financial Statements for the year ended 31st March 2026\",\n    \"Reconciliation the amount of revenue recognised in the statement of profit and loss with the contracted price\"\n  ],\n  \"abstain\": false,\n  \"reason\": \"The revenue from operations as per the statement of profit and loss is directly available