{"arm": "S2", "context_pages": [["9e092bb4d317944f9b65229c7d6cd2efe8032505deb88b934aa3a34f810884e6", 156]], "flow_bucket": "1_corpus_lookup_extraction", "http_status": 200, "label": "SCORED", "latency_ms": 23641, "majority_samples": 3, "model_params_hash": "afec57e6000f365bfd8e1584973673ecf7e6aaaff4237f52e39695d1bfdd6277", "output": "The profit before tax from Aurobindo Pharma's standalone statement for the year ended March 31, 2024, is explicitly mentioned in the document. The value provided is 24,029.2 million Indian Rupees. This value is directly stated in the \"Reconciliation of effective tax rate for the year ended March 31, 2024 and March 31, 2023\" section under the \"Profit before tax from continuing operations\" line. \n\n{\n  \"answer_kind\": \"value\",\n  \"answer_value\": 24029.2,\n  \"unit\": \"million\",\n  \"period\": \"year\",\n  \"basis\": \"standalone\",\n  \"citations\": [\"document_id=9e092bb4d317944f9b65229c7d6cd2efe8032505deb88b934aa3a34f810884e6 page=156\"],\n  \"abstain\": false,\n  \"reason\": \"The value is explicitly stated in the document under the 'Profit before tax from continuing operations' section.\"\n}", "prompt_set_hash": "abc60a7fb40cc1a4b6109b37103000abc826d9961867d71cf690233dd5da7228", "rendered_prompt_hash": "e78b6211d2dd31122c6b4fb76e37c8776ea76e9e6559c132e484d7690bf623b6", "rendered_prompt_hashes": ["e78b6211d2dd31122c6b4fb76e37c8776ea76e9e6559c132e484d7690bf623b6", "e78b6211d2dd31122c6b4fb76e37c8776ea76e9e6559c132e484d7690bf623b6", "e78b6211d2dd31122c6b4fb76e37c8776ea76e9e6559c132e484d7690bf623b6"], "row_id": "G-070", "run_id": "phase2_v1_20261112T173032Z", "samples": [{"http_status": 200, "latency_ms": 10739, "output": "The question asks for the profit before tax from Aurobindo Pharma's standalone financial statements for the year ended March 31, 2024, as printed, in Indian Rupees in millions. \n\nStep-by-step reasoning:\n1. The relevant section is the \"Income Tax\" note, which includes a reconciliation of the effective tax rate for the year ended March 31, 2024.\n2. In this section, the \"Profit before tax from continuing operations\" is listed as 24,029.2 million.\n3. The \"Profit/(Loss) before tax from discontinued operations\" is listed as 724.9 million.\n4. The total profit before tax would be the sum of both continuing and discontinued operations.\n5. However, the question specifically asks for the \"profit before tax from Aurobindo Pharma's the year ended 31 March 2024 standalone statement page, as printed,\" which implies the total profit before tax, including both continuing and discontinued operations.\n6. Therefore, the profit before tax is 24,029.2 (continuing operations) + 724.9 (discontinued operations) = 24,754.1 million.\n\nFinal answer:\n{\n  \"answer_kind\": \"value\",\n  \"answer_value\": 24754.1,\n  \"unit\": \"millions of Indian Rupees\",\n  \"period\": \"year ended March 31, 2024\",\n  \"basis\": \"standalone financial statements\",\n  \"citations\": [\"document_id=9e092bb4d317944f9b65229c7d6cd2efe8032505deb88b934aa3a34f810884e6 page=156\"],\n  \"abstain\": false,\n  \"reason\": \"The profit before tax from continuing operations is 24,029.2 million, and the profit before tax from discontinued operations is 724.9 million. Adding these gives the total profit before tax for the year ended March 31, 2024.\"\n}", "status": "answered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 472, "prompt_tokens": 1825, "prompt_tokens_details": null, "total_tokens": 2297}}, {"http_status": 200, "latency_ms": 5836, "output": "The profit before tax from Aurobindo Pharma's standalone statement for the year ended March 31, 2024, is explicitly mentioned in the document. The value provided is 24,029.2 million Indian Rupees. This value is directly stated in the \"Reconciliation of effective tax rate for the year ended March 31, 2024 and March 31, 2023\" section under the \"Profit before tax from continuing operations\" line. \n\n{\n  \"answer_kind\": \"value\",\n  \"answer_value\": 24029.2,\n  \"unit\