{"arm": "S2", "context_pages": [["4d1c338c892adf88bcfa40799c3d6c77dfc4e44c640cea76e1ca7de7b7bdc6c6", 349], ["e57b7fc675de5a90df876e355e2b4c92b0d6928e6e8a67020496f9fc6700cb53", 309]], "flow_bucket": "2_multi_period_calculation", "http_status": 200, "label": "SCORED", "latency_ms": 23399, "majority_samples": 3, "model_params_hash": "afec57e6000f365bfd8e1584973673ecf7e6aaaff4237f52e39695d1bfdd6277", "output": "The profit for the year in FY2024 was Rs. 12,978 million. In FY2025, the profit for the year was Rs. 14,294 million. The signed difference between these two figures is Rs. 1,316 million. \n\n{\n  \"answer_kind\": \"numerical\",\n  \"answer_value\": 14294,\n  \"unit\": \"million\",\n  \"period\": \"FY2025\",\n  \"basis\": \"profit for the year\",\n  \"citations\": [\"document_id=e57b7fc675de5a90df876e355e2b4c92b0d6928e6e8a67020496f9fc6700cb53\", \"document_id=4d1c338c892adf88bcfa40799c3d6c77dfc4e44c640cea76e1ca7de7b7bdc6c6\"],\n  \"abstain\": false,\n  \"reason\": \"The profit for the year in FY2024 was stated as Rs. 12,978 million, and in FY2025, it was Rs. 14,294 million.\"\n}", "prompt_set_hash": "abc60a7fb40cc1a4b6109b37103000abc826d9961867d71cf690233dd5da7228", "rendered_prompt_hash": "faa898a7511b39661f5c929a22585585c19e97bcf37499f4868c3465c60192f0", "rendered_prompt_hashes": ["faa898a7511b39661f5c929a22585585c19e97bcf37499f4868c3465c60192f0", "faa898a7511b39661f5c929a22585585c19e97bcf37499f4868c3465c60192f0", "faa898a7511b39661f5c929a22585585c19e97bcf37499f4868c3465c60192f0"], "row_id": "G-076", "run_id": "phase2_v1_20261112T173032Z", "samples": [{"http_status": 200, "latency_ms": 9571, "output": "**Step-by-step reasoning:**\n\n1. From the FY2024 report, the \"Profit for the year\" is stated as **12,978** million Indian Rupees.\n2. From the FY2025 report, the \"Profit for the year\" is stated as **14,294** million Indian Rupees.\n3. To find the signed difference, we subtract the FY2024 profit from the FY2025 profit: **14,294 - 12,978 = 1,316** million India